BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (It has become clear that a model trained on a large corpus can be pointed at a new task with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (short prompt instead of a change to its weights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (This report pushes that observation to a much larger scale: a model with 220 billion parameters) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (is measured on many tasks, with no examples, one example, or a handful in the prompt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (The approach is deliberately plain: model and objective stay as they were, and only the prompt's) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (text changes, so that a gain can be credited to the model's use of the examples rather than to a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 654 Td (new training method.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 640 Td (The architecture is autoregressive and the objective is next-token prediction, as in earlier work;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (there is no task-specific head and no fine-tuning step.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (Demonstrations, Not Weights) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (3) Tj ET
endstream
