BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (2 Approach) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (The pre-training recipe follows our earlier report, with a much larger scale and a broader mixture) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (of text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (The family is autoregressive, training a 220 billion parameter autoregressive language model,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (which we call Brellan-220B,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (and its members are named by parameter count.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (Zero-shot scores rise steadily with size, and few-shot scores rise faster,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 654 Td (so the difference between the two settings grows as the model does.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 640 Td (Nothing in these ìlearningî curves involves a gradient update or a fine-tune ó the prompt simply) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (carries more examples.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 612 Td (Brellan-220B, for instance, scores 71.2 F1 on the Quill reading set with no examples, 74.8 with) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 598 Td (one and 77.5 with several.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 584 Td (Some tasks, however, remain difficult for prompting even at this size.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (Demonstrations, Not Weights) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (5) Tj ET
