BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (The web portion was scored by a classifier trained to tell prose resembling a curated corpus) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (from prose that does not, and pages were kept in proportion to that score.) Tj ET
