BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (6.1 Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (Text-only training leaves a model with no grounding in video, touch or the physical world,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (and what it learns comes from writing alone, which leaves out a great deal that a person knows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (Pre-training is also hungry for data: reaching this quality took an enormous corpus.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (Learning a new task from a handful of examples is still less reliable than it is for a person.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (Output can do harm: it can repeat the biases of its training data, invent plausible falsehoods,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (and produce misleading text at scale.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (Demonstrations, Not Weights) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (34) Tj ET
endstream
